<BlogPostLayout frontmatter={{ title: "About", description: "Who runs noise-floor and why this site exists." }}>
  <p>I’m Umar, an engineer working on the edge between signal processing, embedded systems, and software infrastructure. This site is my public notebook.</p>
  <p><strong>noise-floor</strong> is where I document the things I’m building: acoustic localization experiments, digital twin prototypes, and tools around 3GPP technical software. The goal is to show the work as it happens, including the parts that do not work yet.</p>
  <p>If something here resonates with what you’re working on, feel free to reach out via the <a href="../contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
